mode: "100644"
text: "# {{company}}: research brief\n\nRole: {{role}} · Team: {{team}} · Prepared {{today}}{{for_line}}\n\nEvery fact below links its source. Lines marked \"(fill in)\" are for Claude and\nthe user to complete from those sources. Nothing here is guessed.\n\n## The business\n\n{{business}}\n\n## Recent news\n\n{{news}}\n\n## Culture\n\n{{culture}}\n\n## The team you'd join\n\n{{team_section}}\n\n## The interview loop\n\n{{loop}}\n\n## Your angle\n\n(fill in) Two or three true lines that connect the user's own work to this\nteam: the project, the number, the overlap. Pull them from the resume, never\ninvent them.\n\n## Questions to ask\n\n- What does a great first six months look like on {{team}}?\n- What is the hardest technical problem the team is working on right now?\n- How does the team run design reviews and decide between trade-offs?\n- How is on-call shared, and what did the last bad incident teach the team?\n- What made the last person who did well in this role stand out?\n\n## Sources\n\n{{sources}}\n"
